OL,3,GNEWSAWe need more bleed kits, says
OL,4,Amother of stabbed teen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose son died in a stabbing
OL,7,Fhas called for more bleed control kits
OL,8,Fto be installed in town centres.
OL,10,FCamille Harrington's 19-year-old son,
OL,11,FAshton, was found dead with injuries
OL,12,Fconsistent with stab wounds in Kent on
OL,13,FGood Friday.
OL,15,FShe told the BBC that publicly
OL,16,Faccessible bleed control kits - which
OL,17,Fcontain emergency first aid to stop
OL,18,Fsevere bleeding - could potentially
OL,19,Fsave lives.
OL,21,F"[They are] the difference between life
OL,22,Fand death," Camille said.
